{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yncP4ZGyCy0NEwvRNnPwKQ?scene=1","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:31.720599+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yncP4ZGyCy0NEwvRNnPwKQ?scene=1","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>全国优秀大学生交流营</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JBOLTqz3CvQwxvlnnYDcMpibib91HExcPQQU6ZWRgMibZAMoTjNPh3fktq8oFSCkjLQxkr4ouBmRIZdjZNQpmZ0TQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为帮助优秀大学生拓展学术视野，搭建优秀学生与数学研究者之间的学术交流平台，激发青年学子投身数学前沿研究的学术志趣，浙江大学数学科学学院现开展2026年全国优秀大学生交流营活动，具体安排如下：</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/G6EkNyicBNNhn3sHzAszAqYicgxicJtd7EmsXpsTQRSwWFEM1dShmSgu1HJpo5d3icCyMP0KibMw3xVSG59fJClaPGA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>报名条件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JBOLTqz3CvQwxvlnnYDcMpibib91HExcPQQU6ZWRgMibZAMoTjNPh3fktq8oFSCkjLQxkr4ouBmRIZdjZNQpmZ0TQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>全国重点高校2027届本科毕业生，学习成绩优异，学术兴趣浓厚，成绩排名专业前列，有志于从事纯粹数学及与数学相关交叉学科研究工作。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/G6EkNyicBNNhn3sHzAszAqYicgxicJtd7EmsXpsTQRSwWFEM1dShmSgu1HJpo5d3icCyMP0KibMw3xVSG59fJClaPGA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JBOLTqz3CvQwxvlnnYDcMpibib91HExcPQQU6ZWRgMibZAMoTjNPh3fktq8oFSCkjLQxkr4ouBmRIZdjZNQpmZ0TQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2026年4月30日至2026年5月20日</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/G6EkNyicBNNhn3sHzAszAqYicgxicJtd7EmsXpsTQRSwWFEM1dShmSgu1HJpo5d3icCyMP0KibMw3xVSG59fJClaPGA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JBOLTqz3CvQwxvlnnYDcMpibib91HExcPQQU6ZWRgMibZAMoTjNPh3fktq8oFSCkjLQxkr4ouBmRIZdjZNQpmZ0TQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>请在报名截止日期之前点击问卷链接https://v.wjx.cn/vm/Q01CXkc.aspx#，填写报名信息，并在线提交以下材料：</span></p><p><span>1.本科成绩单（包含前五学期所有课程成绩，须加盖学校教务部门红章）及专业成绩排名证明（同年级所在专业排名，须加盖学院教务部门红章）；</span></p><p><span>2.英语成绩证明；</span></p><p><span>3.两封专家推荐信(专家须具有数学专业领域内的高级职称及以上，或具有相当专业技术职称）。请专家在《专家推荐信》（点击阅读原文获取）上填写推荐意见后，用专家本人邮箱发送至mathzju@126.com，邮件的主题命名格式为:2026交流营+学生在读学校全称+学生姓名+专家推荐信。</span></p><p><span>4.其他证明本人的科学研究、学习能力和科研潜能的相关材料，如发表的科研论文或者获奖证书。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/G6EkNyicBNNhn3sHzAszAqYicgxicJtd7EmsXpsTQRSwWFEM1dShmSgu1HJpo5d3icCyMP0KibMw3xVSG59fJClaPGA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JBOLTqz3CvQwxvlnnYDcMpibib91HExcPQQU6ZWRgMibZAMoTjNPh3fktq8oFSCkjLQxkr4ouBmRIZdjZNQpmZ0TQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>所有初审通过的学生获得交流营入营资格，入营信息将通过短信、邮件或者电话方式告知。交流营活动时间预计安排在7月上旬，具体安排另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系信息</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JBOLTqz3CvQwxvlnnYDcMpibib91HExcPQQU6ZWRgMibZAMoTjNPh3fktq8oFSCkjLQxkr4ouBmRIZdjZNQpmZ0TQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>王老师：0571-87953834 （工作日9:00-11:30,14:00-16:30）</span></p><p><span>浙江大学数学科学学院： http://www.math.zju.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span>相关导师信息可登录官网查看（数学科学学院导师：http://www.math.zju.edu.cn/38066/list.htm；数学高等研究院导师：http://www.iasm.zju.edu.cn）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>浙江大学数学科学学院</span></p><p><span>2026年4月30日</span></p></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ib4w2PiaNmRB2uv5ekicI2reExb6qEpVcaGMLjgrwicCYRWM6pjdgYTyqqVpDVlsgB7ClBiacfVIUoFpFEb1mf7ibo5Q/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"9680d8f082a231be904c2790ffe73b96f5077aeba83972776f519cbba8ef9403","textLength":813,"sourceSha256":"03a130022cd835d4eab5f79f3f7a9fa7e9f95ae487da9d30d41fa6534b587567","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-daa49991cf8ce98b5ec6","title":"2026年浙江大学数学科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生交流营报","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:31.720599+00:00"}
